+ *    its options say to its first argument (preventDefault, stopPropagation,
+ *    stopImmediatePropagation), passes emit(bytes) the event (H "id", or
+ *    "id<tab>L" for option latest, + A arguments, for js_event in web-js.cpp)
+ *    and returns undefined at once;
+ *  - values, records and ops: see web-js.cpp.
+ */
